---
source: tests/it/install_planner.rs
expression: p.to_string()
---
Instalar app 2.0.0 (bucket main, 64bit)
  1. Instalar o lançador de comandos em C:\W\shims\.launcher\shim.exe
  2. Baixar [1] https://github.com/kaegi/alass/releases/download/v2.0.0/alass-windows64.zip (alass-windows64.zip, sha256 e81a72f97f592910e909a2352d6b8c0de0801c51ac1383bad4ebf3f2ecdd2fd8)
  3. Extrair [1] alass-windows64.zip para C:\W\apps\app\.staging-2.0.0 (só a subpasta alass-windows64)
  4. Mover C:\W\apps\app\.staging-2.0.0 para C:\W\apps\app\2.0.0
  5. Apontar C:\W\apps\app\current -> C:\W\apps\app\2.0.0 (junção)
  6. Criar comando alass em C:\W\shims (alass.cmd) -> C:\W\apps\app\current\alass.bat
  7. Garantir C:\W\shims no PATH do usuário
  8. Gravar C:\W\apps\app\2.0.0\manifest.json
  9. Registrar app 2.0.0 (main) em C:\W\state.db
